  "text": "Veterinary Oncology Services | Summit Veterinary Referral Center\nSkip to Primary Content\nMap\n2505 S 80th Street,\nTacoma,\nWA,\n98409\nCall\n(253) 983-1114\n24/7 Emergency\n24/7 Emergency\nPhone:\n(253) 983-1114\nAddress:\n2505 S 80th Street,\nTacoma,\nWA,\n98409\nAbout\nOur Story\nOur Team\nServices\n24/7 Emergency & Critical Care\nUrgent Care\nAnesthesia\nInternal Medicine\nNeurology\nOncology\nRadiology\nSurgery\nPet Owners\nWhat to Expect\nPayment Portal\nPrescription Portal\nVet Care Financial Assistance\nFor Veterinarians\nReferrals\nContinuing Education\nCareers\n24/7 Emergency\nOncology\nAbout Our Department\nThe Oncology department focuses on diagnosis, treatment, and supporting patients with cancer. We provide compassionate, personalized care for you and your pet through their entire journey, and we share your family’s commitment to your pet’s quality of life.\nAt your pet’s initial consultation, our goal is to provide you with detailed information about your pet’s condition (to the extent that previous test results allow), recommendations, and rationale for any additional diagnostics, and to explore a spectrum of options. From that foundation, we work with you to create the specific plan that is the best fit for you and your pet. Treatment options for cancer include surgery, chemotherapy, electrochemotherapy, immunotherapy, and a wide spectrum of supportive care options.\nAvailability and Referrals\nOur Oncology department sees patients 5 days per week and is available for direct referral of sick patients for consultation. Pets experiencing truly emergent symptoms are admitted through our ER with in-house oncologist support as indicated.\nOncology\nGabrielle Callanan\nDVM, DACVIM\nView Profile\nCandace Pagano\nDVM, DACVIM\nView Profile\nGabrielle Callanan\nDVM, DACVIM\nView Profile\nCandace Pagano\nDVM, DACVIM\nView Profile\nSummit Veterinary Referral Center\n2505 S 80th Street\nTacoma\n,\nWA\n98409\nT:\n(253) 983-1114\nF:\n(253) 983-1115\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\nOpen 24 hrs\nTue\nOpen 24 hrs\nWed\nOpen 24 hrs\nThu\nOpen 24 hrs\nFri\nOpen 24 hrs\nSat\nOpen 24 hrs\nSun\nOpen 24 hrs\n24/7 Emergency\nOur Story\nServices\nPet Owners\nVeterinarians\nCareers\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms & Conditions\nAccessibility\nCookie Preferences\nDo Not Sell or Share My Information\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
